   "h": 25.2,
   "text": "What Tomatone is",
   "weight": 700
  },
  {
   "id": "tt013t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270,
   "y": 1320,
   "w": 698,
   "h": 65,
   "text": "A gentle way to feel time pass for people who can't.",
   "size": "l",
   "bg": "accent"
  },
  {
   "id": "tt014t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270,
   "y": 1410,
   "w": 460,
   "h": 57.9,
   "text": "Most timers show counting numbers. For someone with ADHD, watching numbers count down creates anxiety, or gets forgotten entirely. Tomatone removes numeric displays completely.",
   "size": "s"
  },
  {
   "id": "tt015t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270,
   "y": 1480,
   "w": 460,
   "h": 57.9,
   "text": "It combines a small wooden-feel cube with a music stream. Instead of an alarm buzzer at the end, the music speeds up slightly and adds subtle rhythmic syncopation. You feel the end approaching without breaking focus.",
   "size": "s"
  },
  {
