   "type": "text",
   "x": 270,
   "y": 3440,
   "w": 460,
   "h": 77.9,
   "text": "The companion mobile app manages music jars and session scheduling. When a student picks up their phone during a session, Tomatone does not trigger a punitive warning or kill a plant. Instead, the music dips softly. Putting the phone down brings the audio back.",
